WEBVTT

00:40:59.142 --> 00:41:00.794
and very beautiful.

00:41:00.818 --> 00:41:03.245
CA: But you knew at
the same time in that decision

00:41:03.269 --> 00:41:08.340
that you were signing up
for one, two years of the deepest pain.

00:41:08.364 --> 00:41:11.443
EG: I thought I was signing up
for six months at the time.

00:41:11.824 --> 00:41:13.923
It turned out to be 18.

00:41:13.947 --> 00:41:16.010
I couldn't be anywhere else
but by her side.

00:41:16.034 --> 00:41:17.621
From the minute of her diagnosis,

00:41:17.645 --> 00:41:21.084
it was physically painful for me
to be anywhere but in the room with her.

00:41:21.108 --> 00:41:23.640
There was nowhere else
in the world I could have been,

00:41:23.664 --> 00:41:26.296
and the idea of anyone else
going through that with her

00:41:26.320 --> 00:41:27.471
made me enraged.

00:41:27.495 --> 00:41:31.005
The first doctor's appointments
that she went to, I wasn't there,